BindProfileAccount.description:
Atomic compare-and-set request for the existing Profile `account` field.
Both values are canonical Koru Identity UUIDs without the storage prefix;
emails, names, and provider subjects have no representation here.

RunHeader.description:
What the Run document carries (D14).

There is no conversion to or from [`crate::AttemptState`], and these two
doctests keep it that way: the day someone writes the `From`, they fail.

```compile_fail
use koru_delegate_core::{AttemptState, RunHeader};
fn sync_side(state: AttemptState) -> RunHeader { state.into() }
```

```compile_fail
use koru_delegate_core::{AttemptState, RunHeader};
fn execution_side(header: RunHeader) -> AttemptState { header.into() }
```

WeekStartPreference.description:
The synchronized override for phrases whose meaning depends on the first
day of the week. System delegates to each device's regional setting;
authored overrides travel with the profile.
